          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="A fall in global diesel supply reduces available bunker and marine diesel for sustained PLA sorties and patrols, directly cutting the tempo and duration of naval and air shows of force around Taiwan (and conversely a supply increase enables higher sortie rates)." />
