          <attvalue for="34" value="0.55" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Higher sanctions‑evasion success demonstrated in the Russia–Ukraine context reveals practical procurement routes, intermediary networks and component substitution techniques that China can adopt or replicate to accelerate acquisition and integration of restricted technologies, raising its defense build rate." />
