          <attvalue for="34" value="0.75" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Acute spikes in coercive military actions around Taiwan trigger immediate global risk repricing and surge in hedging activity, raising realized and implied volatility in eurozone fixed‑income and related derivatives markets." />
