          <attvalue for="34" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="A spike in gray‑zone coercion around Taiwan forces redistribution of US/allied naval assets and raises insurer perceptions of correlated naval risk, prompting shipowners and insurers to reprice Middle East fuel routes and raise shipping premiums." />
