          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Sustained increases in coercive incidents drive shipping firms to avoid transits through chokepoints perceived as underprotected (e.g., Red Sea/Suez) because of reduced escort availability and tighter ROE, reducing tanker voyage frequency through those corridors." />
